WEBVTT

00:00:00.267 --> 00:00:14.267
Bottom line: recommend sending a focused cross-functional team to PPCC 2026 with one objective: return with a governed AI, app, and automation pilot proposal.

00:00:14.833 --> 00:00:18.333
This is a recommendation, not a measured outcome.

00:00:18.333 --> 00:00:25.100
Treat the event as a structured learning sprint for business, platform, data, and risk leaders.

00:00:25.667 --> 00:00:37.733
PPCC runs October 27 through 29 at the MGM Grand in Las Vegas, with separate applied workshops before and after the main conference.

00:00:38.267 --> 00:00:48.233
Microsoft frames the agenda around Copilot, agents, apps, automation, and data working together as governed business solutions.

00:00:48.233 --> 00:00:55.300
The FAQ emphasizes real implementation, architecture, governance, and AI-driven scenarios.

00:00:55.300 --> 00:01:00.633
That combination connects innovation ambition to execution controls.

00:01:01.167 --> 00:01:10.800
After the event, ask for one pilot charter that names the workflow, owner, trusted data, guardrails, and a testable success measure.

00:01:10.800 --> 00:01:14.867
Expand only if that evidence supports the next decision.
